      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The trogg is a 5th level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 12, +4 to hit with spell attacks). The trogg has the following shaman spells prepared:</p>\n<p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>Cantrips (at will):</strong> <em>mold earth|XGE</em>, <em>shocking grasp</em>, <em>produce flame</em></p>\n<p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>1st level (4 slots):</strong> <em>earth tremor|XGE</em>, <em>elemental shock|WC5E Spells</em>, <em>chromatic orb</em>, <em>absorb elements|XGE</em></p>\n<p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>2nd level (3 slots):</strong> <em>lava burst|WC5E Spells</em>, <em>maximilian's earthen grasp|XGE</em></p>\n<p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>3rd level (2 slots):</strong> <em>earthen spike|WC5E MoM</em>, <em>stinking cloud</em></p>",
